  "2026-11-27T10:45:22.778Z",codex-agent,"Reproduce pending-only drift before edits. Trace the SDK, standalone and host check paths, preserve exact versioned comparison, and verify the package release scripts with a pending package version."
  "2026-11-27T10:46:18.186Z",codex-agent,"Reproduced on 6617b03: two dated tags, committed versioned changelog, then a single chore(deps) bump. File check exited 1 (tracker_changed); the entire diff added only Unreleased / Dependencies / Bump pending package from 2 to 3. Baseline repository changelog:check passed."
  "2026-11-27T10:54:40.368Z",codex-agent,"Implemented the comparison in the SDK file check, using the generator's Markdown section boundaries. Both command entry points report pending_only and honor --check-pending. Two branches, both Dependabot squash-subject cases, strict mode, versioned corruption, and non-Git SDK/host parity passed in the fixed fixtures."
  "2026-11-27T11:01:00.014Z",codex-agent,"Verified four external scripts perform their own whole-file comparisons. Follow-up unbraind/pm-changelog#385 tracks pm-ops, pm-slack, pm-gantt-chart and pm-review with immutable source links. The direct package check remains the only implementation changed here."
  "2026-11-27T11:06:22.370Z",codex-agent,"Release rehearsal in a disposable full clone: changed package.json from 2026.11.24 to 2026.11.27 and added a synthetic dependency commit. The repository changelog:full wrote '## 2026.11.27 - 2026-11-27' with the 1 to 2 range and PR link. changelog:check passed without writing. Editing the release entry to 1 to 3 failed (exit 1, tracker_changed); regeneration restored SHA-256 8ddf1cef075b69e4c6ac8354d83d835520c714de7ff938e93b38e16648b26528."
  "2026-11-27T11:06:30.306Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral reverts in a disposable package: restoring whole-file comparison failed 5 acceptance cases (including both #382 squash cases and concurrent integration); accepting versioned edits failed 3; dropping strict comparison failed 2; omitting the standalone receipt, host advisory or release note each failed 1. Baseline files and tests were retained. Source and test typechecks and docstring lint passed. The optional fleet ESLint comparison found 9 pre-existing diagnostics on both base and head and no new diagnostic."
  "2026-11-27T11:10:09.127Z",codex-agent,"All restored controls passed (6/6). Additional exact-build reverts: disabling pending comparison failed all 3 selected property/SDK/installed-host checks; dropping the final pending separator rule failed the non-Git case. Restored 3/3. The registered pm test command passed 8/8 with zero skips, including decoded host JSON and TOON and 32 deterministic mixed pending/released edits."
  "2026-11-27T11:10:14.920Z",codex-agent,"Actual npm and Bun installs from one tarball each passed 7/7 verdicts across the SDK, standalone and pm host, with both host receipt formats decoded and file bytes retained. Verified all 115 tar members and installed contents; SHA-256 8c30bae78d1681bbd83ca95f1a75239e332a4955eed550328544f85baa9f975f. Package content scan: 115 files, zero findings."
  "2026-11-27T11:17:45.813Z",codex-agent,Repeated the pending-version release rehearsal after syncing main and rebuilding the final package. Full/check passed and the mutated release range failed. The restored complete file on this base has SHA-256 9c6a2bdfd1da289cc40f80d38971bbe6763fca0e58128ad29571f9362147e7ce. A separate local pm health read reports the same globally available pm-github host version skew and legacy 32 provenance records in a base clone.
  "2026-11-27T11:30:30.931Z",codex-agent,"Targeted local gate passed 1052/1052 tests in 39 suites across 56 test files with zero skips or cancellations. Ran node --test --test-concurrency=2 on touched files and references at the repository's quick CI depth. The dedicated in-process human-output assertion also passed after its addition. Source/test compilation, typecheck, docstring lint, release rehearsal and installed artifact checks passed. Coverage and complete npm/Bun release gates remain for CI at their existing thresholds."
